%% Title: User Journey
%% Description: End-to-end flow from first launch to skill progression

flowchart TD
    A[First Launch] --> B{API Keys<br/>Configured?}
    B -- No --> C[Onboarding Page]
    C --> D[Enter Name, Role,<br/>Skill Level]
    D --> E[Configure 6 API Keys]
    E --> F[Keys Saved to Keychain]
    F --> G[POST /engineer/setup]
    G --> H[Dashboard]

    B -- Yes --> H
    H --> I[Choose Topic +<br/>Select Agents]
    I --> J[Room Setup]
    J --> K[Add Context<br/>URLs/Files]
    K --> L[Start Room]
    L --> M[Live Debate Session]
    M --> N[Listen to Agents<br/>Join When Ready]
    N --> O[Session Ends]
    O --> P[Debrief Generated]
    P --> Q[Review Scores +<br/>Knowledge Gaps]
    Q --> R[XP Earned]
    R --> S{Another<br/>Session?}
    S -- Yes --> H
    S -- No --> T[View Progress]
